      "releases": [
        {
          "name": "@tangleai/assistant",
          "type": "minor"
        }
      ],
      "summary": "Ship an assistant pack for every language `@jarenjs/locales` ships. `@tangleai/assistant/messages/ja`, `/ko`, `/ru`, `/tr` and `/zh-tw` export formal Japanese, Korean, Russian, Turkish and Traditional Chinese (Taiwan) catalogues with exactly the English keys, under the names Jaren's packs use (`zhTW` from `/messages/zh-tw`), so a host passes the assistant pack and the Jaren pack of one language side by side. Russian agrees the words around a count with its one, few and many forms; Japanese, Korean and Chinese count with counters; Turkish keeps the noun singular after a number. The catalogue gains `md/page-break`, `md/permalink`, `md/permalink-section`, `md/backref` and `md/backref-occurrence`, and a reply's page breaks, heading permalinks and footnote back-references are named from them, in each pack with the wording of the same language's Jaren pack; English output is unchanged. The Pages game's validation-language switch offers all eleven Jaren packs.",
      "id": "assistant-jaren-languages"
